                <notes>
                    <note>This day is published by G. and A. Ewing...with the addition of a
                        dictionary of whist; which resolves almost all the critical cases that may
                        happen at the game; also a whole chapter of thirteen new cases, never before
                        published. The Polite Gamester. Containing short treatises on the games of
                        whist, quadrille, backgammon, piquet and chess, together with an artificial
                        memory, or an easy method of assisting the memory of those that play at the
                        game of whist. By Edmond Hoyle, Gent. N. B. This thirteenth edition of the
                        game of whist, with the above additions, not in any other edition printed in
                        this kingdom, may be had separate, price 4d. Be careful to ask for the
